## A new DynArray of the Ints from smallest to largest; `v` is as it was
## (`sort` sorts in place).
##
## # Parameters
## - `v`: a DynArray.
##
## # Returns
## A new DynArray.
##
## # Examples
## ```pyking
## use mutation
## import dynarray
## v = dynarray([3, 1, 2])
## print(dynarray.sorted(v), v)
## ```
## ```stdout
## dynarray([1, 2, 3]) dynarray([3, 1, 2])
## ```
public def int::sorted(v: DynArray(Int)) -> DynArray(Int):
    dynarray(list.sort(list(v)))


## A new DynArray of the Floats from smallest to largest; `v` is as it was
